      "request": {
        "question": "青岚卡和石港卡怎么区分，各自通向哪座楼？",
        "candidates": [
          {"candidate_id": "c1", "source_kind": "synthetic", "role": "user", "text": "两张通行卡的作用分析完了，那给它们各取一个名字吧。", "excerpt_incomplete": false},
          {"candidate_id": "c2", "source_kind": "synthetic", "role": "assistant", "text": "我的记录是：青岚卡通向南楼，石港卡通向北楼。", "excerpt_incomplete": false},
          {"candidate_id": "c3", "source_kind": "synthetic", "role": "user", "text": "上次门禁系统的机柜位置写错了，更正：机柜在二楼，不在一楼。", "excerpt_incomplete": false},
          {"candidate_id": "c4", "source_kind": "synthetic", "role": "user", "text": "你把两张卡的去处对调了：青岚对应北楼，石港对应南楼。卡名没有改。", "excerpt_incomplete": false},
          {"candidate_id": "c5", "source_kind": "synthetic", "role": "assistant", "text": "两张通行卡的照片已经归档。", "excerpt_incomplete": false}
        ]
      },
      "expected": {"must_inspect": ["c4"], "must_not_inspect": ["c3"], "must_not_discard": ["c2"]}
    },
    {
